@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam arrowColor #555555
skinparam componentBorderColor #777777
skinparam nodeBorderColor #777777
skinparam databaseBorderColor #777777
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #777777
skinparam cloudBorderColor #777777
skinparam packageBorderColor #999999
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E8F5E9

title Configuration Anomaly Detection (CAD) — System Architecture

actor "SRE / Operations User" as SRE
actor "Deployment Engineer" as DepEng
actor "Developer / Contributor" as Dev

cloud "External Systems" {
    component [PagerDuty] as PD
    component [AWS] as AWS
    component [OCM\n(OpenShift Cluster Manager)] as OCM
    component [Alert Source\n(External Webhook)] as AlertSrc
}

package "CAD Container Image\n(UBI Minimal Runtime)" {
    component [cadctl CLI\n(/bin/cadctl)] as cadctl

    package "Integration Package Library" {
        component [PagerDuty Integration] as PDInt
        component [AWS Integration] as AWSInt
        component [OCM Integration] as OCMInt
    }

    component [CHGM Workflow Handler] as CHGM
    component [Anomaly Detection &\nCommunication Module] as AnomalyDet
    component [Mitigation & Disposition\nHandler] as MitigDisp
}

package "Build Environment\n(Go 1.17 Builder Image)" {
    component [Container Build Process] as BuildProc
}

package "Tekton Execution Environment\n(configuration-anomaly-detection namespace)" {
    component [EventListener] as EventListener
    component [Trigger] as Trigger
    component [PipelineRun\n(cad-checks-pipeline)] as PipelineRun
    database [Deployment YAML\nManifests] as DeployYAML
}

package "Deployment & Maintenance Assets" {
    component [Template Update Utility] as TemplateUtil
    database [Deployment Template\nArtifacts] as TemplateArtifacts
}

note right of cadctl
  Entry point: /bin/cadctl
  Container constraint: UBI minimal base
  Build constraint: Go 1.17 builder
end note

note right of PipelineRun
  apiVersion: tekton.dev/v1beta1
  Pipeline: cad-checks-pipeline
  Namespace: configuration-anomaly-detection
  Param: payload (JSON, event.data.id)
end note

SRE --> cadctl : invoke CAD workflows\n(CHGM, anomaly handling)
SRE --> DepEng : coordinate execution paths
DepEng --> EventListener : configure webhook-driven path
DepEng --> PipelineRun : submit PipelineRun\n(skip-webhook path)
Dev --> cadctl : extend CLI commands
Dev --> TemplateUtil : run template update utility
Dev --> BuildProc : build container image

BuildProc --> cadctl : produces /bin/cadctl\nin container image

cadctl --> CHGM : execute CHGM workflow\n(FR-002)
cadctl --> AnomalyDet : detect anomalies &\nsend communications (FR-003)
cadctl --> MitigDisp : execute mitigation /\ndisposition actions (FR-004)

cadctl --> PDInt : call PagerDuty integration
cadctl --> AWSInt : call AWS integration
cadctl --> OCMInt : call OCM integration

PDInt --> PD : PagerDuty API
AWSInt --> AWS : AWS API
OCMInt --> OCM : OCM API

MitigDisp --> PDInt : silence / escalate alerts
MitigDisp --> OCMInt : update support status,\nrecord follow-up events

AlertSrc --> EventListener : external alert webhook\n(FR-005, DR-005)
EventListener --> Trigger : webhook received
Trigger --> PipelineRun : create PipelineRun\n(standard event-driven path)

DepEng --> PipelineRun : create PipelineRun directly\n(skip-webhook path, FR-006, C-006)

PipelineRun --> cadctl : executes cadctl\nwith JSON payload\n(event.data.id)

DeployYAML --> PipelineRun : YAML manifest\n(v1beta1 PipelineRun, C-004)

TemplateUtil --> TemplateArtifacts : update deployment\ntemplate artifacts (FR-010)
TemplateArtifacts --> DeployYAML : provides deployment\nmanifest templates

@enduml
